{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KSE03RrdwINkmNuEwJ0npQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.787944+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KSE03RrdwINkmNuEwJ0npQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJQLBvibo2Zrlxf4Gt8hMNmZD0YFnTEPjx4ERvKWbppic342ibHNEGWib8icg8jQ086JQ8byAWFYm5cL1ug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJQLBvibo2Zrlxf4Gt8hMNmZDCWGkdp1Y6vrzBIDFWiba7Q79Oskmq8wPQZC28mbNAKZuGsEVMZHNO8w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南京理工大学新能源学院成立于2020年，坐落在“江尾海头”的江阴市，定位服务于国家战略性新兴产业——新能源产业，紧密围绕“碳达峰、碳中和”目标下的节能减排和能源转型等国家战略，在保持学科传统优势的同时，突出新兴交叉学科的特色，致力于培养基础扎实、创新意识强、适应面广、具有国际视野的工程精英和社会中坚，为国家能源结构转型升级和新兴能源产业发展提供人才和技术支撑。</span></p><p><span>学院本硕教育及指导体系健全，拥有教育部最早批准设置的新能源科学与工程本科专业，以及清洁能源技术专业学位硕士授权点，导师团队由国家级高层次人才、海外高层次青年人才组成。首届本科生出国升学率69.1%，历年就业生均进入新能源相关行业工作，发展前景广阔。</span></p><p><span>学院突出产教融合办学特色，整合地方优势，深入探索校企合作新机制，与长三角地区头部企业共建江苏省高校重点实验室、江苏省人才攻关联合体、江苏省外国专家工作室等省部级平台，聚焦长三角地区特色产业需求，在风光氢储氨醇一体化和工业减污降碳等研究领域，不断深化产学研协同创新，为企业破解“卡脖子”技术难题，实现科技成果转化，持续为地方经济社会发展贡献力量。</span></p><p><span>本次活动旨在增进优秀学生对南京理工大学新能源学院的全面了解，激发学生科研兴趣，为热爱科研、德才兼备、立志升学深造的优秀学子搭建交流的平台。活动在南京理工大学江阴校区开展。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJQLBvibo2Zrlxf4Gt8hMNmZDCWGkdp1Y6vrzBIDFWiba7Q79Oskmq8wPQZC28mbNAKZuGsEVMZHNO8w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>30人</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线下（南京理工大学江阴校区）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年7月14日-7月23日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2026年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为能源动力类（新能源科学与工程及其相关专业）、材料类（新能源材料与器件、材料化学及其相关专业）、化学化工类（催化、储能、物理化学及其相关专业）等，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过新能源学院网站（网址：https://xny.njust.edu.cn/）和交流宣传群（QQ群号：816954894）进行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）校园开放日申请表（在报名系统中填写后生成）；</span></p><p><span>（2）个人简历；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科阶段成绩单（由教务部门盖章），有条件的可提供院系或导师推荐意见；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科阶段各类荣誉、获奖证书；</span></p><p><span>（5）国家英语四六级考试成绩、TOEFL成绩或GRE/GMAT成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明；</span></p><p><span>（6）体现自身水平的代表性论文、出版物或原创性工作成果（如专利、发明、制作、软件等）。</span></p><p><span>请将以上材料1-6扫描后按照顺序整合成一个PDF文档，以“本科学校+姓名+校园开放日”格式命名后在申请时间内发送至yz129@njust.edu.cn邮箱。</span></p><p><span>特别注明：申请人提交的全部材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，取消报名资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJQLBvibo2Zrlxf4Gt8hMNmZDJQ80tkOLR8sdgaiaSxZ7P9fC4oBuSib3DICYBKlvor81XTHXRkpsE3dg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>*以最终通知为准</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：常老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0510-82181220</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：yz129@njust.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>报名人员加群二维码（QQ）：816954894</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJQLBvibo2Zrlxf4Gt8hMNmZD74xZNM5e6mg85lsl75TpqgMHM0Z2r8lO97Pee3BTiaFKMzibhcUtoz2w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJQLBvibo2Zrlxf4Gt8hMNmZDTB4KAaeEKrrXDCib3WP80TVtAibN4jbTT7icglNGyUGb8wUOZYW35CGXw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 新能源学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 代芳冰</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华  新能源学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 齐玉辉</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d4ee8f6846af6e66d78c95dc33c3569c35f3a7fda596a1827d0b8f496e0d22bc","textLength":1448,"sourceSha256":"18f4112a5e371f74c536fe5cd65f41969484fff286a4392019eaf069c4df5c78","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-462d18fc6f124a951616","title":"2025年南京理工大学新能源学院2025年校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.787944+00:00"}
